    "title": "State Police: Attempted Kidnapping in Tidioute \"Did Not Occur\" - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Hagberg ,\n5 hours ago TIDIOUTE, Pa. – After an “extensive investigation,” Pennsylvania State Police determined that an attempted kidnapping reported last week “did not occur.”. The alleged kidnapping was reported to have occurred at the intersection of Main and Elm Streets at approximately 8:15 p.m. on Thursday, June 11, 2026. Read full article\n1",
